ntent\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":1,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Born in the seaport city of Syracuse in Sicily around 287 BC, his work laid the foundations for many modern scientific fields and his inventions have left a lasting impact on technology.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGnsB-enn80-Q5kvRHO8SJUCBnR_Rz18MXE36Kmw1AnTSu3h72tPpws0NPaihwkvHRV7wGZIpvpS4K3sj39fP6ywd95EUbDfmYbUz-yqylnAATMuRMIoeLlZdlmSvzVVRzDeyg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":2,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Born in the seaport city of Syracuse in Sicily around 287 BC, his work laid the foundations for many modern scientific fields and his inventions have left a lasting impact on technology.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpP9px-NIEe9Pj3Zf4BbyjkFqD5x6W6D3lzm1O7jr4GzN7gHCXxOnSU8ypRomIfCk4Aj9G5j7yHRIabgD2m3crklrOgLu3iP_52SxxHUFLh6TkFhbHq8B_zlIFb0dgoUiorYPmVmqnSVj1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":3,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"Few concrete details are known about Archimedes's life, though much of his work is documented through his correspondence with other mathematicians and in a series of books and manuscripts.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":4,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"His father was an astronomer named Phidias, and it is believed that Archimedes may have been related to King Hiero II, the ruler of Syracuse, with whom he was on intimate terms.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpP9px-NIEe9Pj3Zf4BbyjkFqD5x6W6D3lzm1O7jr4GzN7gHCXxOnSU8ypRomIfCk4Aj9G5j7yHRIabgD2m3crklrOgLu3iP_52SxxHUFLh6TkFhbHq8B_zlIFb0dgoUiorYPmVmqnSVj1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":5,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"His father was an astronomer named Phidias, and it is believed that Archimedes may have been related to King Hiero II, the ruler of Syracuse, with whom he was on intimate terms.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":6,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"It's also likely that he spent time in Alexandria, Egypt, which was the intellectual center of the ancient world, studying with the successors of Euclid.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":7,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"It's also likely that he spent time in Alexandria, Egypt, which was the intellectual center of the ancient world, studying with the successors of Euclid.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":8,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"During the siege of Syracuse, he developed an array of war machines so effective they long delayed the city's capture.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpP9px-NIEe9Pj3Zf4BbyjkFqD5x6W6D3lzm1O7jr4GzN7gHCXxOnSU8ypRomIfCk4Aj9G5j7yHRIabgD2m3crklrOgLu3iP_52SxxHUFLh6TkFhbHq8B_zlIFb0dgoUiorYPmVmqnSVj1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":9,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"These included catapults, cranes to lift enemy ships out of the water, and possibly a system of mirrors to set ships ablaze using the sun's rays.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"These included catapults, cranes to lift enemy ships out of the water, and possibly a system of mirrors to set ships ablaze using the sun's rays.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtpD-6mWFzRKSFrP2D8DbOjNm78E8K1Xk3RJsZaptv8t6YIEl99E2jRLx2LJJVxP1rp9aIW7tZ8V0OVUa1sqQp3UqcagONJB_sgIcG24kbudTlftgJ63ahsCMgHWa5ctj3q6LcxmSoKxO_MLJHc81gh25nwG2l\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"These included catapults, cranes to lift enemy ships out of the water, and possibly a system of mirrors to set ships ablaze using the sun's rays.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwlub6Dg467dkLPC1rhUCaPaFFsM2hYzblp_N2HdhKlT1_DbKJ-iE2AztL60khKbme8dtp_RELSRzy5TMvSLiNS7vHQY-LcxfvKVVRSi7CM5c0WXWflKlrwAwq8Gvp26fjf1Ey3KVJ0O7nNca9PSAYU9Gd5zq7SlmTZu1D1IFWLpwDaqtAXbE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"His death in 212 or 211 BCE during the capture of Syracuse is the subject of a famous anecdote.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpP9px-NIEe9Pj3Zf4BbyjkFqD5x6W6D3lzm1O7jr4GzN7gHCXxOnSU8ypRomIfCk4Aj9G5j7yHRIabgD2m3crklrOgLu3iP_52SxxHUFLh6TkFhbHq8B_zlIFb0dgoUiorYPmVmqnSVj1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"A Roman soldier reportedly found Archimedes engrossed in a mathematical problem drawn in the sand and killed him when he refused to leave his work, uttering the phrase, \\\"Don't disturb my circles.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtpD-6mWFzRKSFrP2D8DbOjNm78E8K1Xk3RJsZaptv8t6YIEl99E2jRLx2LJJVxP1rp9aIW7tZ8V0OVUa1sqQp3UqcagONJB_sgIcG24kbudTlftgJ63ahsCMgHWa5ctj3q6LcxmSoKxO_MLJHc81gh25nwG2l\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"Archimedes's contributions to mathematics were profound and far-reaching, with many of his proofs and calculations still considered masterpieces of rigor and ingenuity.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGWb5U5C1-3cwpcM4HBCsjrwoyyZucJTRZiEev47Mf76AFJsU-YBwtLw8-_61pxSDm0m53c1pdkjMzn5YhZ_UNlyu-vzOe_sXMxdRhuKyr8yKMjkwdL14vtTuAn4pZNefDRkQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"He determined that pi was between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71, an upper limit that was still in use until the advent of electronic calculators.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"He determined that pi was between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71, an upper limit that was still in use until the advent of electronic calculators.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"He determined that pi was between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71, an upper limit that was still in use until the advent of electronic calculators.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGWb5U5C1-3cwpcM4HBCsjrwoyyZucJTRZiEev47Mf76AFJsU-YBwtLw8-_61pxSDm0m53c1pdkjMzn5YhZ_UNlyu-vzOe_sXMxdRhuKyr8yKMjkwdL14vtTuAn4pZNefDRkQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Geometry of Spheres and Cylinders:** Archimedes considered his greatest achievement to be his discovery of the relationship between the surface area and volume of a sphere and its circumscribing cylinder.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpP9px-NIEe9Pj3Zf4BbyjkFqD5x6W6D3lzm1O7jr4GzN7gHCXxOnSU8ypRomIfCk4Aj9G5j7yHRIabgD2m3crklrOgLu3iP_52SxxHUFLh6TkFhbHq8B_zlIFb0dgoUiorYPmVmqnSVj1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pnccs.edu.in\",\"data\":\"*   **Geometry of Spheres and Cylinders:** Archimedes considered his greatest achievement to be his discovery of the relationship between the surface area and volume of a sphere and its circumscribing cylinder.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE126L8kubMqAPwiu8bYbMdQQEgw9n8DhspcaE6JP792C4vxc_yeFJS_iBhvusyjYbxNroamffNk9e5XeRCoJq1L9RiNtiWp7UAcI-XRYUngCFEOCOaipTtDME97kc-jfDHg_SVkAWXrObqNFvnHdG-aSThOhF8GBxACc7a184SOU43VQNPW8DjsbOoJCA1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pnccs.edu.in\",\"data\":\"He proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of the cylinder that encloses it, a discovery he requested be inscribed on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE126L8kubMqAPwiu8bYbMdQQEgw9n8DhspcaE6JP792C4vxc_yeFJS_iBhvusyjYbxNroamffNk9e5XeRCoJq1L9RiNtiWp7UAcI-XRYUngCFEOCOaipTtDME97kc-jfDHg_SVkAWXrObqNFvnHdG-aSThOhF8GBxACc7a184SOU43VQNPW8DjsbOoJCA1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"He proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of the cylinder that encloses it, a discovery he requested be inscribed on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtpD-6mWFzRKSFrP2D8DbOjNm78E8K1Xk3RJsZaptv8t6YIEl99E2jRLx2LJJVxP1rp9aIW7tZ8V0OVUa1sqQp3UqcagONJB_sgIcG24kbudTlftgJ63ahsCMgHWa5ctj3q6LcxmSoKxO_MLJHc81gh25nwG2l\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Method of Exhaustion:** He developed the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" an early form of integral calculus, to calculate the areas of irregular shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXq0-2C_tG2ZQwBnlk94obP4KKUMOYTH9-TgBSRN9_7JRMZk2fIo11TktKUxyw1_YAAKIVbJl_JCQIMV_tGEr1V7MNNXWCU5iCR8gIcNElKskfJat1S0z22hDmhhH0pUupTm4NdqG_po5xNlp27PJjTUAGqeLTUxpqGdphEN3YeSlsUsK1T8VrpPCLAsH5\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cuemath.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Method of Exhaustion:** He developed the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" an early form of integral calculus, to calculate the areas of irregular shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQErBO0Z2ILf8--XBmjX01I_E_Wmz4-_9cd863P9lu8rYenlM3Lx5JE8Y1K8sjRZ7Vc5mSgpP8aCwUs9IVr9mqPPRdwigLbvpWwg2RPvQde63zCuYt3uWhJPKrNRsdTZIq1IdKXcJhOMaWTK0pH0AEna-W3D\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"This involved dividing a shape into an increasing number of smaller, measurable parts to find its approximate area or volume.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGWb5U5C1-3cwpcM4HBCsjrwoyyZucJTRZiEev47Mf76AFJsU-YBwtLw8-_61pxSDm0m53c1pdkjMzn5YhZ_UNlyu-vzOe_sXMxdRhuKyr8yKMjkwdL14vtTuAn4pZNefDRkQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"This involved dividing a shape into an increasing number of smaller, measurable parts to find its approximate area or volume.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXq0-2C_tG2ZQwBnlk94obP4KKUMOYTH9-TgBSRN9_7JRMZk2fIo11TktKUxyw1_YAAKIVbJl_JCQIMV_tGEr1V7MNNXWCU5iCR8gIcNElKskfJat1S0z22hDmhhH0pUupTm4NdqG_po5xNlp27PJjTUAGqeLTUxpqGdphEN3YeSlsUsK1T8VrpPCLAsH5\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"elephantlearning.com\",\"data\":\"This involved dividing a shape into an increasing number of smaller, measurable parts to find its approximate area or volume.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGvzOrfRQiXN1Rn2FKuYCXZFnxATdw6CqqHGuqIIJaJ3mciLTVMpbfH9OS-bIxn75IKxozjEfR7vv_tyN2sAkhoYA6kYEb7MTwxMPwAe_dyPK3kbjEOw4U8OSMCyhfdlMIiuL5dJEa1eWgKiAPbxY8gmxGLBS5nRoqVOHnRgMoEHgpNMrYjj6WyH65IYvU=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Large Numbers:** In his work *The Sand Reckoner*, Archimedes devised a system for expressing incredibly large numbers, demonstrating how exponents could be used to write a number greater than the grains of sand needed to fill the universe.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGnsB-enn80-Q5kvRHO8SJUCBnR_Rz18MXE36Kmw1AnTSu3h72tPpws0NPaihwkvHRV7wGZIpvpS4K3sj39fP6ywd95EUbDfmYbUz-yqylnAATMuRMIoeLlZdlmSvzVVRzDeyg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Large Numbers:** In his work *The Sand Reckoner*, Archimedes devised a system for expressing incredibly large numbers, demonstrating how exponents could be used to write a number greater than the grains of sand needed to fill the universe.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":29,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Archimedes was one of the first to apply mathematical principles to physical phenomena, essentially creating the sciences of mechanics and hydrostatics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGnsB-enn80-Q5kvRHO8SJUCBnR_Rz18MXE36Kmw1AnTSu3h72tPpws0NPaihwkvHRV7wGZIpvpS4K3sj39fP6ywd95EUbDfmYbUz-yqylnAATMuRMIoeLlZdlmSvzVVRzDeyg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":30,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"Archimedes was one of the first to apply mathematical principles to physical phenomena, essentially creating the sciences of mechanics and hydrostatics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":31,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He provided the first detailed explanation of the principle of the lever in his work *On the Equilibrium of Planes*.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwlub6Dg467dkLPC1rhUCaPaFFsM2hYzblp_N2HdhKlT1_DbKJ-iE2AztL60khKbme8dtp_RELSRzy5TMvSLiNS7vHQY-LcxfvKVVRSi7CM5c0WXWflKlrwAwq8Gvp26fjf1Ey3KVJ0O7nNca9PSAYU9Gd5zq7SlmTZu1D1IFWLpwDaqtAXbE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":32,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He provided the first detailed explanation of the principle of the lever in his work *On the Equilibrium of Planes*.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFP03hx_H2S-no-GLccgF6BaoJ3ZLkVXxlp4KPSGu-X4EY7FhTcR6Oyj_LrsVw2Je8UUoAk8RZthVHYDmXNrc0sAFy7XJJQ9AAQx84oXSjM26-8ELdInGmylnRNYTHXg_hc-GzLjHSJJ6TWWL8YsyZwsCa2znDAkvtL_nS9dteYdMkollvv8CQktXklobx29BpQ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":33,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"This led to his famous declaration, \\\"Give me a place to stand on, and I can move the earth.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwlub6Dg467dkLPC1rhUCaPaFFsM2hYzblp_N2HdhKlT1_DbKJ-iE2AztL60khKbme8dtp_RELSRzy5TMvSLiNS7vHQY-LcxfvKVVRSi7CM5c0WXWflKlrwAwq8Gvp26fjf1Ey3KVJ0O7nNca9PSAYU9Gd5zq7SlmTZu1D1IFWLpwDaqtAXbE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":34,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"This led to his famous declaration, \\\"Give me a place to stand on, and I can move the earth.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFP03hx_H2S-no-GLccgF6BaoJ3ZLkVXxlp4KPSGu-X4EY7FhTcR6Oyj_LrsVw2Je8UUoAk8RZthVHYDmXNrc0sAFy7XJJQ9AAQx84oXSjM26-8ELdInGmylnRNYTHXg_hc-GzLjHSJJ6TWWL8YsyZwsCa2znDAkvtL_nS9dteYdMkollvv8CQktXklobx29BpQ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":35,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cuemath.com\",\"data\":\"He also developed pulley systems to help sailors move heavy objects.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQErBO0Z2ILf8--XBmjX01I_E_Wmz4-_9cd863P9lu8rYenlM3Lx5JE8Y1K8sjRZ7Vc5mSgpP8aCwUs9IVr9mqPPRdwigLbvpWwg2RPvQde63zCuYt3uWhJPKrNRsdTZIq1IdKXcJhOMaWTK0pH0AEna-W3D\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":36,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Center of Gravity:** Archimedes created the fundamental concept of the center of gravity and discovered methods for finding the center of gravity of various plane figures and solids.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":37,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Center of Gravity:** Archimedes created the fundamental concept of the center of gravity and discovered methods for finding the center of gravity of various plane figures and solids.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":38,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"*   **Center of Gravity:** Archimedes created the fundamental concept of the center of gravity and discovered methods for finding the center of gravity of various plane figures and solids.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":39,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Archimedes' Principle:** His most famous discovery is the principle of buoyancy.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":40,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"Legend has it that he made this breakthrough while in the bath, noticing that the water level rose as he submerged his body.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtpD-6mWFzRKSFrP2D8DbOjNm78E8K1Xk3RJsZaptv8t6YIEl99E2jRLx2LJJVxP1rp9aIW7tZ8V0OVUa1sqQp3UqcagONJB_sgIcG24kbudTlftgJ63ahsCMgHWa5ctj3q6LcxmSoKxO_MLJHc81gh25nwG2l\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":41,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"He realized that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":42,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"He realized that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFP03hx_H2S-no-GLccgF6BaoJ3ZLkVXxlp4KPSGu-X4EY7FhTcR6Oyj_LrsVw2Je8UUoAk8RZthVHYDmXNrc0sAFy7XJJQ9AAQx84oXSjM26-8ELdInGmylnRNYTHXg_hc-GzLjHSJJ6TWWL8YsyZwsCa2znDAkvtL_nS9dteYdMkollvv8CQktXklobx29BpQ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":43,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"This principle provided a method for determining the purity of a golden crown made for King Hiero II.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":44,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"Archimedes was a talented inventor, creating a variety of practical devices, many of which were solutions to problems related to the defense of Syracuse.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":45,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes' Screw:** He is credited with inventing a screw-shaped machine for raising water, likely inspired by his time in Egypt.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":46,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes' Screw:** He is credited with inventing a screw-shaped machine for raising water, likely inspired by his time in Egypt.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":47,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes' Screw:** He is credited with inventing a screw-shaped machine for raising water, likely inspired by his time in Egypt.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtpD-6mWFzRKSFrP2D8DbOjNm78E8K1Xk3RJsZaptv8t6YIEl99E2jRLx2LJJVxP1rp9aIW7tZ8V0OVUa1sqQp3UqcagONJB_sgIcG24kbudTlftgJ63ahsCMgHWa5ctj3q6LcxmSoKxO_MLJHc81gh25nwG2l\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":48,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"This device, powered by hand or by animals, was used for irrigation and for removing water from the holds of ships.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":49,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cuemath.com\",\"data\":\"This device, powered by hand or by animals, was used for irrigation and for removing water from the holds of ships.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQErBO0Z2ILf8--XBmjX01I_E_Wmz4-_9cd863P9lu8rYenlM3Lx5JE8Y1K8sjRZ7Vc5mSgpP8aCwUs9IVr9mqPPRdwigLbvpWwg2RPvQde63zCuYt3uWhJPKrNRsdTZIq1IdKXcJhOMaWTK0pH0AEna-W3D\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":50,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"Variations of the Archimedes' screw are still used today, for instance, in some wastewater treatment plants.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":51,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Odometer:** The Roman architect Vitruvius credited Archimedes with creating the first odometer, a device to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":52,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Odometer:** The Roman architect Vitruvius credited Archimedes with creating the first odometer, a device to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwlub6Dg467dkLPC1rhUCaPaFFsM2hYzblp_N2HdhKlT1_DbKJ-iE2AztL60khKbme8dtp_RELSRzy5TMvSLiNS7vHQY-LcxfvKVVRSi7CM5c0WXWflKlrwAwq8Gvp26fjf1Ey3KVJ0O7nNca9PSAYU9Gd5zq7SlmTZu1D1IFWLpwDaqtAXbE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":53,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"It was designed as a cart with a wheel of a known circumference that would drop a pebble into a container after a certain number of revolutions, thus tracking the distance traveled.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmE7lA5bH8gqGpUxN2fw3hD5T3vW5fvvbtNq_Gh0rOZfur6_Qfk5KPm4mXYEiuwdY5V0nD5dvEqVmO18s63MAz9CuhPKoroOG5tABNKxKt4Xr8mf3nKVXQqfH6YlLKAQI=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":54,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"It was designed as a cart with a wheel of a known circumference that would drop a pebble into a container after a certain number of revolutions, thus tracking the distance traveled.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwlub6Dg467dkLPC1rhUCaPaFFsM2hYzblp_N2HdhKlT1_DbKJ-iE2AztL60khKbme8dtp_RELSRzy5TMvSLiNS7vHQY-LcxfvKVVRSi7CM5c0WXWflKlrwAwq8Gvp26fjf1Ey3KVJ0O7nNca9PSAYU9Gd5zq7SlmTZu1D1IFWLpwDaqtAXbE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":55,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** As mentioned, he designed the \\\"Claw of Archimedes,\\\" a crane-like weapon used to lift Roman ships out of the water during the siege of Syracuse.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFtpD-6mWFzRKSFrP2D8DbOjNm78E8K1Xk3RJsZaptv8t6YIEl99E2jRLx2LJJVxP1rp9aIW7tZ8V0OVUa1sqQp3UqcagONJB_sgIcG24kbudTlftgJ63ahsCMgHWa5ctj3q6LcxmSoKxO_MLJHc81gh25nwG2l\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":56,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** As mentioned, he designed the \\\"Claw of Archimedes,\\\" a crane-like weapon used to lift Roman ships out of the water during the siege of Syracuse.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQECVOjLZHX4ncq_4bqYkU3V8aKXJj-0AKB1bzDhM7Nj_SyiBtPuG7crtKwzOXRxDoD8X6P95YHXGYUKQ_tzAdzqFfizzlaY_85-uJc_21muhGIdutFDONi7jnpFgjmIviALqqlYxGWdGAFyLCxXQgpvL-V7E-Lj6kFHypG32aO3kIby3YKRr8bIoWJgHv9veNkDUz1x1coPvBatW-ld\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":57,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"He also improved the catapult and was said to have created a \\\"heat ray\\\" using mirrors to set enemy ships on fire, though the historical reality of this invention is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwlub6Dg467dkLPC1rhUCaPaFFsM2hYzblp_N2HdhKlT1_DbKJ-iE2AztL60khKbme8dtp_RELSRzy5TMvSLiNS7vHQY-LcxfvKVVRSi7CM5c0WXWflKlrwAwq8Gvp26fjf1Ey3KVJ0O7nNca9PSAYU9Gd5zq7SlmTZu1D1IFWLpwDaqtAXbE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":58,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"He also improved the catapult and was said to have created a \\\"heat ray\\\" using mirrors to set enemy ships on fire, though the historical reality of this invention is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQECVOjLZHX4ncq_4bqYkU3V8aKXJj-0AKB1bzDhM7Nj_SyiBtPuG7crtKwzOXRxDoD8X6P95YHXGYUKQ_tzAdzqFfizzlaY_85-uJc_21muhGIdutFDONi7jnpFgjmIviALqqlYxGWdGAFyLCxXQgpvL-V7E-Lj6kFHypG32aO3kIby3YKRr8bIoWJgHv9veNkDUz1x1coPvBatW-ld\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":59,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Planetarium:** Archimedes is also said to have built a planetarium device that demonstrated the movements of the then-known celestial bodies.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGnsB-enn80-Q5kvRHO8SJUCBnR_Rz18MXE36Kmw1AnTSu3h72tPpws0NPaihwkvHRV7wGZIpvpS4K3sj39fP6ywd95EUbDfmYbUz-yqylnAATMuRMIoeLlZdlmSvzVVRzDeyg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":60,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"*   **Planetarium:** Archimedes is also said to have built a planetarium device that demonstrated the movements of the then-known celestial bodies.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtrXDp4M73mt5iyzaqPexXAL0-RPjlSPBAwkfXBtKPy-EP88tw_sf95oiS-o_jMuN3fy-w23a4lq55BVBxIVPY4_l2m8cjHpi5h574Ws4hRmXmPqF7LE60NE6sM3IRCKKFM9faHfMHEr-gt8LhvKehWg0L\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":61,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"Archimedes's legacy is immense; he laid the groundwork for many principles of modern mathematics and science, and his work directly inspired later scientific giants like Galileo Galilei and Isaac Newton.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPst7ELjmu5BRhqEq8MbGeYdwNB7vDtj_scDlqw0-1oI_1AaLqu3PeSXZ4JJaDcKsgFMph2x6Js50kUCJ2hjIgEC9fBf65m_NXP0fgH9b3fFq0L_zplg112GNlOwOase27Ro82m-Pm\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":62,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pnccs.edu.in\",\"data\":\"Archimedes's legacy is immense; he laid the groundwork for many principles of modern mathematics and science, and his work directly inspired later scientific giants like Galileo Galilei and Isaac Newton.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE126L8kubMqAPwiu8bYbMdQQEgw9n8DhspcaE6JP792C4vxc_yeFJS_iBhvusyjYbxNroamffNk9e5XeRCoJq1L9RiNtiWp7UAcI-XRYUngCFEOCOaipTtDME97kc-jfDHg_SVkAWXrObqNFvnHdG-aSThOhF8GBxACc7a184SOU43VQNPW8DjsbOoJCA1\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"content\":\"\"},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"f5fce8bd-e87d-4e0a-9754-c48502e3489a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"index\":0}],\"created\":1763978269,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":{\"completion_tokens\":1402,\"prompt_tokens\":8,\"total_tokens\":1410}}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
